---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/content';
---
<Layout title="Get project support"><PageIntro eyebrow="For community-led ideas" title="Help your next step take root." description="Explore the kinds of support described in AEF’s project history, and start a conversation about what your community needs." /><section class="section container"><div class="notice"><strong>Funding availability: {site.applicationsStatus === 'unconfirmed' ? 'please confirm with the team' : site.applicationsStatus}</strong>{site.applicationsMessage}</div><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card"><p class="eyebrow">01 · Resources</p><h3>Small grants.</h3><p>Historical support includes regenerative farming, education, tree planting, and responses to climate-related disruption.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><p class="eyebrow">02 · Connections</p><h3>Practical support.</h3><p>Mentorship, learning opportunities, tools, and help sharing a project’s story can be just as valuable as funding.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><p class="eyebrow">03 · Partnership</p><h3>Fiscal sponsorship.</h3><p>Explore whether an ongoing relationship with a nonprofit could help your project access resources.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fiscal-sponsorship/">Learn more <Icon /></a></article></div></section><section class="section container two-column" style="padding-top:0"><div class="prose"><h2>A simple first conversation.</h2><p>You do not need to prepare a long application to ask about availability. Start with your community, the challenge you are addressing, and the next step you want to take.</p><h3>Helpful things to share</h3><ul><li>Where your project is and who leads it.</li><li>What your community wants to change.</li><li>What you have already tried or achieved.</li><li>The support you need and any important timing.</li></ul><p class="source-note">AEF’s January 2022 page described grants of $50–$2,500, subject to resources, project needs, and mission fit. This is a historical range, not a current offer. <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20220118082051/https://abundantearthfoundation.org/how-to-apply-for-funding/">Archived source ↗</a></p></div><InquiryForm topic="Project support" /></section></Layout>
